{"tt20192960":"Kkomjjang ma! Dangsini beominiji?!","tt20192962":"Dorang chineun gime gajae jabajundan yaegi","tt20192964":"Naegayo. Hagiro haetseumnida, simingyeongchal","tt20192970":"Honja sallyeogoyo. Wanbyeokage honja","tt20192980":"Na? Jeo yeoja, pateuneo!","tt20192990":"Geuge pateuneojanayo. Okei?","tt20253032":"Sarang. Nado hal su itdago","tt20253044":"Nal jugin angma. Jabajwo","tt20493364":"Ppalli malhaebwayo. Naneun joahanikka!","tt20494638":"Neo, chachaungirago anya","tt20721614":"Jeo, pungbaengnimgwa honinhagetseumnida!","tt20726358":"Dangsineul... ijeya araboneyo","tt20856092":"Chepjokj (gyeoljahaeji)","tt20856100":"Yonggiya sosara! Rururarirurupong!","tt21031598":"Insaeng choegoui jigwondeul, itji aneul geomnida","tt21031602":"Jigeumbuteo syotaim!"}